WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.500
A new chat with Claude. One line: "read my launch plan notebook".

00:08.500 --> 00:15.000
Claude reads the notebook's map first, then only the pages it needs.

00:15.000 --> 00:22.500
It answers with the whole project: decisions, launch plan, pricing.

00:22.500 --> 00:28.000
Now a change: "teams pay $49 a month per café; update the pricing".

00:28.000 --> 00:30.000
Claude edits two pages and leaves them uncommitted, as the notebook asks.

00:30.000 --> 00:39.500
In Quillipi, its changes are marked in the margin. Nothing is committed yet.

00:39.500 --> 00:46.000
It looks right, so: "looks good, commit it".

00:46.000 --> 00:52.000
Claude commits, with a message that says what changed.

00:52.000 --> 00:57.100
The commit in History: made by Claude, and the pages it touched.
